# D10(a) NEGATIVE (decisions.md, ratified 2026-07-06): re-binding a mutable
# borrow to an existing local through assignment (`r = &a`) is the same
# named-`&`-bind class as the VarDecl-init form — rejected. Pre-D10 the `&`
# was silently ignored (the assignment cloned, `a` was never written
# through — a silent trap, not an alias).
# Expected: error[E_LocalBorrowBind] at the `&a` RHS.
void main():
    Vector[int] a = [1, 2, 3]
    auto r = a
    r = &a
    r.push(9)
    print(a.len())
